## Acceptance

In order to get any license under these terms, you must agree to them as both strict obligations and conditions to all your licenses.

## Seats

You may use the software only while you hold a seat.  Each seat covers one individual developer.

  a. A **paid seat** is bought from the licensor.  It covers any purpose, including commercial use and use by or for a government institution.
  b. A **free seat** covers only noncommercial purposes - see [Noncommercial Purposes](#noncommercial-purposes).  You get a free seat by registering with the licensor at <https://www.GabrielMoraru.com/autopilot>.  The free seat starts when the licensor confirms your registration.  The licensor may decline a registration.

